From 3f068beb4bd289ba0c39de7b3ec4efed5dddbc6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:56:11 +0000
Subject: software_isp: Adapt the soft ISP stack to upstream's interfaces

Rebasing onto upstream (EGL context handling, the IPA context's camera
sensor helper and sensor controls, the IPA's configure() returning its
controls, std::span, RGB<double> parameters, the softisp name) leaves the
stack's own algorithms (AGC, AWB, CCM) on their own context members, which
this commit reconciles with the new interfaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
